  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Trump unveils results of $14m reflecting pool makeover in final appeal before midterms",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/02/trump-reflecting-pool-renovation-midterms",
      "description": "<p>US president shares delayed results of chaotic renovation on DC site as Americans prepare to head to the polls</p><p>Donald Trump <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2xrn-nfxk2w\">unveiled</a> the delayed results of his $14m renovation of Washington DC’s <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/11/reflecting-pool-repair-company-plan-flaws\">Lincoln Memorial reflecting pool</a> in what is expected to be his final press conference before voters head to the polls for the midterm elections.</p><p>On the eve of a consequential election day, with polls indicating that most voters feel the US president has grown too focused on building projects in the nation’s capital, he stood in front of the newly opened reflecting pool to discuss – in detail – changes to the pool’s pipe, the grass surrounding the area and granite.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/02/trump-reflecting-pool-renovation-midterms\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-02T20:42:37"
    },
    {
      "title": "Trump focuses on Washington DC construction projects on eve of midterm election as Democrats climb in polls – live",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/nov/02/democrats-haley-stevens-mike-rogers-abdul-el-sayed-michigan-midterms-trump-rallies-latest-news-updates",
      "description": "<p>President at reflecting pool in Washington DC to talk about various projects in final appearance before Americans head to polls to vote in crucial midterm election</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/feb/17/sign-up-for-the-breaking-news-us-email-to-get-newsletter-alerts-direct-to-your-inbox?utm_medium=ACQUISITIONS_STANDFIRST&amp;utm_campaign=BN22326&amp;utm_content=signup&amp;utm_term=standfirst&amp;utm_source=GUARDIAN_WEB\">Sign up for the Breaking News US email</a></p></li></ul><p>The latest and final New York Times and Siena College <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/01/us/politics/times-siena-poll-senate.html\">poll </a>before the midterm elections also shows <strong>Abdul El-Sayed leading Mike Rogers in the US Senate race in Michigan by 11 percentage points</strong>, outside the margin of error.</p><p>The survey took place before Democratic Congresswoman Haley Stevens announced that she would back Rogers in the contest – a vital seat for her party to retain in their quest for control of the Senate.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/nov/02/democrats-haley-stevens-mike-rogers-abdul-el-sayed-michigan-midterms-trump-rallies-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-02T20:38:49"
    },
    {
      "title": "How Israel is at the heart of Haley Stevens’s extraordinary reversal",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/02/haley-stevens-israel-aipac",
      "description": "<p>The issue runs through almost every twist and turn and has come to define the congresswoman’s political persona</p><p>For Haley Stevens, the road from Democratic Senate candidate to campaigning alongside a Republican she once called a rubber stamp for Donald Trump has been remarkably short – and the issue running through almost every twist and turn has been Israel.</p><p>Having failed to stop Abdul El-Sayed in the primary, Stevens chose to back Republican Mike Rogers on Sunday, a candidate who she previously warned would enable Trump’s agenda – apparently because the Democrat who won refuses to share her position on Israel.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/02/haley-stevens-israel-aipac\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-02T19:15:23"
    },
    {
      "title": "Democratic Rep. Stevens endorses Republican Rogers over rival El-Sayed in Michigan Senate election",
      "link": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/01/michigan-senate-stevens-rogers-endorsement-el-sayed.html",
      "description": "Haley Stevens had lost the Democratic nomination for Senate in Michigan to Abdul El-Sayed earlier this year.",
      "source_name": "CNBC Top News",
      "published": "2026-11-01T21:06:42"
